---@field iamServiceName? string The DNS name of the service (e.g. "resourcemanager.googleapis.com"). This should be the domain name part of the full resource names (see https://aip.dev/122#full-resource-names), which is usually the same as IamServiceSpec.service of the service where the resource type is defined.
---@field resource? gcp.iap_v1.Resource IAM resource to check permission on
---@field iamPermission? string Permission to check in IAM.
---@field policyName? gcp.iap_v1.PolicyName Policy name to be checked

